// Notes:
// - Clock variable is increased before reading the window contents (can only read past data)
// - First monitor streams every second: can fit 6 elements in a 6.001s window
// - Second monitor streams every 2 seconds: can fit 3 elements in a 6.001s window
// - Third monitor streams every 3 seconds: can fit 2 elements in a 6.001s window
